NOTE ON BUNDLED THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This repository redistributes binaries from the vgmstream project
(https://github.com/vgmstream/vgmstream) inside the tools/ directory and,
at build time, embedded into the produced executable:

    tools/vgmstream-cli.exe
    tools/*.dll

Those files are licensed as follows, and are Copyright (c) the vgmstream
project and its contributors:

  * vgmstream's own code (vgmstream-cli.exe, libatrac9/libcelt/libg719_decode/
    libmpg123/libspeex/libvorbis/xmp-vgmstream DLLs) is distributed under a
    permissive ISC-style license. The full text is provided in
    tools/vgmstream-COPYING.txt.

  * The four FFmpeg-derived libraries (avcodec-vgmstream-59.dll,
    avformat-vgmstream-59.dll, avutil-vgmstream-57.dll,
    swresample-vgmstream-4.dll) are licensed under the GNU Lesser General
    Public License v2.1 (LGPL-2.1).

The full license text in tools/vgmstream-COPYING.txt, together with
tools/vgmstream-LICENSE.txt, must be preserved when redistributing these
files, including when they are embedded into an executable.

The MIT license above applies only to the original source code in this
repository (src/ and documentation), not to those third-party binaries.
